{"t_ms": 778859, "conversation_id": "conv_sentence_end_s0_041", "turn_id": 1, "actor": "system", "event_type": "retrieval_result", "payload": {"passages": ["Laundry Service\n\nGrand Horizon Hotel & Suites\n\nLaundry services are available daily from 8:00 AM to 8:00 PM. Guests may place their laundry in the designated laundry bag provided in the room and contact housekeeping for collection. Regular laundry is typically returned within 24 hours, while express service is available for an additional charge.", "# corpus/ \u2014 Hotel Documents\n\n**Owner: Lakshya**\n\n## What this folder is\n\nThe hotel's documents live here: the knowledge the assistant answers from. About 60 short \ndocuments covering things like pool and gym hours, check-in and check-out rules, menus, and \npolicies.\n\n## How to fill it\n\nSee the full instructions in `retrieval/README.md` (Step 1). In short:\n- Write ~60 short documents, one topic per file, as `.txt` or `.md`.\n- Make them realistic and varied.\n- Deliberately plant a few contradictions (e.g. one doc says the pool closes at 10 PM, \n  another says 9 PM) and keep a note of which ones, for a later experiment.\n\nThe index-building script reads every file in this folder, so anything you put here becomes \npart of the searchable knowledge.\n", "Dry Cleaning Service\n\nGrand Horizon Hotel & Suites\n\nProfessional dry cleaning services are available for delicate garments such as suits, dresses, and formal wear. Clothing collected before 10:00 AM is generally returned by the following evening. Charges vary depending on the garment type and are added to the guest's final bill."], "scores": [0.7182140946388245, 0.7800427079200745, 0.7858568429946899], "timing_policy": "sentence_end", "timing_trigger": "sentence_end", "user_end_known_at_finish": true, "launch_offset_ms_vs_user_end": 1368, "overlap_with_speech_ms": 0, "forecast_invalidated": false}}
